                    data-aos-duration="1000">
                    <h2 class="mb-0">Empowering Women in Space Industry</h2>
                    <p class="fs-5 mb-0">SHE ORBITS is a multidisciplinary Space &amp; STEM global company dedicated to
                      advancing women's participation in aerospace technology, satellite missions, and space
                      exploration. We bridge the gender gap in STEM through quality training, global recognition,
                      practical research, and 30+ space and STEM sectors where learners can discover their path into the
                      future space industry.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="row gap-5">
                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                  <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-6 pt-9 border-top" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200"
